      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boiling_Springs%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Episode 13 of Route 66’s second season was filmed in Boiling Springs, showcasing the town’s classic 1950s charm.",
